{"id":"dcc12b835f971076","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-sigma-11.md","title":"$\\Sigma^1 1$","display":"df-sigma-11 — $\\Sigma^1_1$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sigma-11","aliases":["58-df-sigma-11"],"display":"df-sigma-11 — $\\Sigma^1_1$","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sigma-11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sigma-11</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-11 — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2631de10a773dc04\" href=\"?note=2631de10a773dc04\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S\\)</span> (Polish 空间中解析集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2631de10a773dc04\" href=\"?note=2631de10a773dc04\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Sigma^1_1(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Sigma^1_1(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> sets are continuous images of Borel sets.</li>\n<li>They are also called analytic sets.</li>\n<li>本别名复用已经显式携带 Baire 拓扑、积拓扑、Borel 谓词与投影公式的解析集原子，不再依赖未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1(X\\times\\omega^\\omega)\">\\(\\Pi^0_1(X\\times\\omega^\\omega)\\)</span> 类记号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2631de10a773dc04","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2631de10a773dc04","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S$ (Polish 空间中解析集谓词, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}11\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Sigma^1_1(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Sigma11}_S(A,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1(X\\times\\omega^\\omega)","display":false}],"bytes":1055,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-sigma-11.md|58-df-sigma-11]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["2631de10a773dc04"]}